  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81a85dc56b7b7f94fa634dcc180696b9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingScreen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RallyX::RallyX.UI.LoadingScreenConfig
  panelSettings: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98f72d98cf83f6144a1db02422542c16, type: 2}
  layout: {fileID: 9197481963319205126, guid: d007eb772ce927e438c77cf2f4a1e0cc, type: 3}
  tracks: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f85cd8d28d7b4314b847115708f781ef, type: 2}
  tips:
  - Brake in a straight line before the corner, then turn in. The car grips best
    when it isn't doing both.
  - A tap of the handbrake swings the tail round a hairpin. Hold the throttle to
    keep the slide going.
  - Gravel and dirt spin the wheels sooner than asphalt. Squeeze the throttle out
    of slow corners.
  - Mud and grass slow you right down. Stay on the road, even if it means a wider
    line.
  - Hold the brake in the air to dip the nose, the throttle to lift it, and land
    square.
  - Upgrades are bought per car. The garage shows what each stage does before you
    pay.
  - A top-three finish at Pine Valley opens Red Canyon, and harder tracks pay more
    credits.
  - Rev the engine on the grid during the countdown. It won't move until GO.
  - Change volumes and vibration in SETTINGS, from the main menu or the pause menu.
  fadeIn: 0.22
  hold: 0.35
  fadeOut: 0.4
